# Canonical release version source (spec: "Replace scattered 1.0.0 values with
# one canonical release version source").
#
# Every consumer either reads this file (bundle scripts, xcodebuild arguments,
# release workflow) or is verified against it (MarkdownCLI.version,
# project.yml, Info.plist templates).  Do not edit the values in project.yml,
# Scripts/bundle-app.sh, or Sources/drdownright/MarkdownCLI.swift directly —
# Scripts/sync-versions.sh proves they agree.
#
# MARKETING_VERSION is the human-facing CFBundleShortVersionString.
# CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION is the numeric CFBundleVersion, which MUST increase
# monotonically with every release because Sparkle orders updates by it.
# Release builds replace it with the tagged build number; this file carries the
# nominal value used by local dev builds.
MARKETING_VERSION=1.0.8
CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION=8
